WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.347
Every enquiry gets retyped into a brief by hand.

2
00:00:05.347 --> 00:00:07.058
Then chased for whatever's missing.

3
00:00:07.058 --> 00:00:08.530
That's hours, every week.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.950
So we built the Enquiry-to-Viewing Desk.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.010
It reads the email,

6
00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:15.340
the call or the web form,

7
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:16.457
and builds the brief.

8
00:00:16.457 --> 00:00:18.940
And where something's unclear, it says so.

9
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.853
It drafts the one question that matters,

10
00:00:28.853 --> 00:00:29.827
and when she replies,

11
00:00:29.827 --> 00:00:31.930
the answer goes straight into the brief.

12
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.840
Confirm it, and the search starts from the right brief.

13
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.543
That's around six hours a week back for every broker,

14
00:00:54.543 --> 00:00:56.040
spent on viewings instead.

15
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.100
Every enquiry. Ready to view.
